 "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "3773658732765551"}]}, "change_log": "Drone Core Command v0.92\n\n- slightly bumped damage of drone's air-assisted attack\n- modified repair process to more directly align a repair point with the repair targeting display\n- improved performance in the hub\n- fixed an issue where bypassing tutorial was possible", "created_date": 1780339624, "id": "26816375277991065", "version": "0.92", "version_code": 92, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25243862388575703", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26994671406828117"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "3773658732765551"}]}, "change_log": "Drone Core Command v0.91\n\n- slightly bumped damage of drone's air-assisted attack\n- modified repair process to more directly align a repair point with the repair targeting display\n- improved performance in the hub", "created_date": 1780331386, "id": "26814889844806275", "version": "0.91", "version_code": 91, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25243862388575703", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26994671406828117"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "3773658732765551"}]}, "change_log": "Drone Core Command v0.90\n\n- updated narrative names and descriptions for the corelink weapons\n- updated onboarding with another approach that integrates wayfinding into the style of the game\n- modified battle hud with a few tweaks", "created_date": 1780077024, "id": "26774288538866406", "version": "0.90", "version_code": 90, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "25243862388575703", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26994671406828117"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "3773658732765551"}]}, "change_log": "//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////\nDrone Core Command v0.89\n\n- updated menu and hub landscape with some new environment art that works a little better with the tutorial\n- added structure collapse sound fx\n- updated mortar impact sound fx\n- fixed a bug where selecting the map overview text would play the wrong text voiceover\n- continued systems balancing - amped chaingun damage a bit and increased its spread/cover", "created_date": 1779921947, "id": "26748846461410614", "version": "0.89", "version_code": 89, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}